						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Look before you stick that foot in your mouth?<br /><br />WoW - 2 million subscribers in early June, they didn&#039;t release in China&nbsp; and gain the other 1.5 mil people till June 7th, and the numbers weren&#039;t realeased right away.<br /><br />EQ2 - Announced in Jan 2005 they broke 300k subscribers.&nbsp; They even had the add slogan, we did in three months what took EQ three years...<br /><br />Lineage - If you don&#039;t know how big of a deal Lineage was/is you obviously didn&#039;t read much, or know any Koreans in EQ.<br /><br />EQ - No idea personally, but considering he&#039;s right on everything else I doubt he&#039;s lying.&nbsp; Plus he&#039;s talking paid accounts not active players.&nbsp; <br /><br />He&#039;s been doing it for a few years now, it&#039;s not like his site is new.&nbsp; And I&#039;ve never seen him called on the carpet as being wrong either.<br /><br />You&#039;re welcome to your opinon, but your examples of him being wrong are.... um... wrong =P<br /><br /><br /></td>
