						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left"><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">No, what&#039;s really funny is that I didn&#039;t comment at all about how valid his opinion was or not, but you can&#039;t read. Now that&#039;s amusing, good sir! Oh, ha ha...jolly good!<br /></div><br />Really?<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I simply said I didn&#039;t give a crap about his retired, trolling opinion...<br /></div><br />Actually what you said was this...<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Why don&#039;t you go post suggestions for the game you actually play where people might give a crap</div><br />You didn&#039;t say &quot;I&quot; you said &quot;people&quot;.&nbsp; You were speaking for, arguably, the entire EQ community, and at the minimum the people here on this board.<br /><br />If Matteo&#039;s statement was valid, but you don&#039;t &quot;give a crap&quot; simply because he&#039;s retired.... well...you&#039;re a bigot.&nbsp; I was giving you the benefit of the doubt with the invalid remark.&nbsp; If you think his statement was valid, you&#039;ve got a much bigger problem.<br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I, and probably the majority of the mid-level raiders on this board, am just plain tired of the constant condescending attitude that your type constantly spew.<br /></div><br />If Matteo was being pretentious I could see your point.&nbsp; But he&#039;s not, he&#039;s been there, he&#039;s done it.&nbsp; He has as much experience with Coirnav and Guild Politics as you, and quite possibly more.&nbsp; (He was the leader of DA if you didn&#039;t know)<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Toastie&#039;s posts, for example, are about as useful as a case of the clap and serve no other purpose other than to belittle the majority of the people who still play on RN and to inflate his own, apparently very very needy, ego.<br /></div><br />Last I checked I&#039;m not Toastie.&nbsp; And neither is Matteo.&nbsp; If you want to follow that logic in justifying your statements, why don&#039;t we just throw every Muslim in&nbsp; prison since Al-Qeida agents are Muslims too?&nbsp; Kind of plays into that bigotry thing.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">And while I&#039;m passing out suggestions, I&#039;ll be generous enough to issue you a copy of the suggestion I gave Matteo. Take your condescending opinions and shove them....straight up your ass. Here...have a stick <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/poke.gif" alt="poke" border="0" /><br /></div><br />Do you even know what condescending means?&nbsp; What exactly did I say previously that was condescending?&nbsp; Big words are all well and good to make you look smarter, but you just look even less intelligent when you screw up and use them incorrectly.<br /><br />Here&#039;s my suggestion.&nbsp; Rate each person on the merits of what they say.&nbsp; If you&#039;ve written off Toastie because of his comments that&#039;s fine, but don&#039;t assume Matteo or myself are the same because we&#039;re all retired.<br /><br />&nbsp;</td>
