						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">The concept that because we&#039;re retired from EQ makes our opinions invalid is funny.<br /><br />We did this content 2+ years ago that your doing now, it&#039;s not like we don&#039;t know what we&#039;re talking about.<br /><br />Hell, while DA/EiE were Time flagging, Ascent did a backflag event, and ended up blowing a Coirnav.&nbsp; The encounter had been changed and their old strat didn&#039;t work right.&nbsp; We sure as hell didn&#039;t want to lose the next 6days for them to flag 20 or so people, and possibly even longer.&nbsp; They sent their applicants and some members along and got their flags.<br /><br />Cock-blocking and being an ass has it&#039;s place, but when it doesn&#039;t benefit any of you ... well that&#039;s just retarded... unless of course it gets you a chubby.&nbsp; If you find it entertaining then go for it.<br /><br /><br /></td>
