							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16666#msg16666">Quote from: simplee on April 28, 2005, 09:44:48 am</a></div><div class="quote"><br />I was under the impression that the first guild to a certain point in content was the #1 in progression... did the rules change?&nbsp; First no longer equals #1 in progression?<br /></div><br />That quite possibly is the gayest attempt at trying to claim #1 I have ever seen.&nbsp; If you honestly believe you are in the #1 spot now...&nbsp; grow some balls and actually say it.&nbsp; Don&#039;t hide behind the word progression, either you&#039;ree better or you&#039;re not.<br /><br />I have no clue what the current difficulty level is of encounters but I&#039;m quite sure the current guilds do, and if this toastie guy actually knows what he&#039;s talking about you are even more pathetic.<br /><br />As much of a slime as he was, I&#039;m pretty sure even Eelyen had balls (there was webcam verification I&#039;m told)</td>
