							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">I&#039;m not sure if your post shows you&#039;re just incredibly stupid, or you just don&#039;t give a shit about right and wrong.&nbsp; The former I suppose can be forgiven for bad genetics.<br /><br /><br />&quot;Shows you what u know shrek. You don even play anymore and yeah so what used Mq the first couple times to save time.&quot;<br /><br />How does my lack of playing matter in pointing out the fact you&#039;re a cheater?&nbsp; Was I somehow wrong?<br /><br />&quot;Still have to kill the Mshas, never once did MQ kill a single boss mob EVER.&quot;<br /><br />Lets use a real life comparison to this can help you out.&nbsp; Keep in mind, in a computer game, it&#039;s just cheating, in real life it&#039;s crime.&nbsp; When you go to the store to buy that new Britney Spears CD you&#039;ve always wanted, you still have to give them money to get it.&nbsp; However, there is a difference if you worked at McDonald&#039;s to get the cash, or you broke into the place after hours and stole the payroll money.&nbsp; Same money, but one of those options will most likely end up with you guarding your corn-hole very carefully for a few years.<br /><br /><br />&quot;And for not wanting us to kill them, screw taking a 40some person raid to kill a mob thats one grpable and taking 3hrs to kill it when it can be done in an hr.&quot;<br /><br />Passing over the obvious cheating that was required, I can&#039;t really say much more than Jeet did above.&nbsp; Nice way to treat your guild though, I can&#039;t see why anyone would ever dislike you.<br /><br /><br />&quot;And yeah over 60% of your alliance members use MQ and other progams&quot;<br /><br />I love how you said &quot;your&quot; alliance.&nbsp; I really have no idea about the circumstances behind your tenure in EiE, but I&#039;m quite sure they were &quot;your&quot; alliance long after they were mine.<br /><br />I can&#039;t really touch on the 60% cheater statement, as it&#039;s not my place to defend EiE&#039;s integrity anymore.&nbsp; I will say I highly doubt it.<br /><br />&quot;And yes i been a full member, again spouting what u dont know.&quot;<br /><br />Now here is where your stupidy shines through loud and proud... I said...<br /><br />&lt;Shrek Quote&gt;&quot;Are you even past the applicant stage with Assent?&quot;<br /><br />Now if you read that above statement, at the end of it is a &quot;?&quot; character.&nbsp; This means it was posed as a question, therefore how exactly did I &quot;spout what u dont know&quot; *again*... or fuck, for that matter what was I wrong about the first time?<br /><br />&quot;Just was point out the fact that over 30% of the folks on the kill were from RN that u guys talked shit about and were too good to be associated with.&quot;<br /><br />First off, until very recently I had never heard of any of you, let alone talked about you.&nbsp; However, you act as if by robbing a bank and being shunned by the locals *you* are somehow being wronged.<br /><br />&quot;Why would you not let your members get gear on thier own, instead of having them sit in ele armor. Why hold people back?&quot;<br /><br />Why let an item rot?&nbsp; Those kind of questions all go to the same root questions of any virtual economic scenario.&nbsp; Try working this one out in your head...all of a sudden every hamburger joint in the world charges $1 for a burger, but McDonalds gives hamburgers away for free.&nbsp; What happens?<br /><br /><br />I won&#039;t speak for anyone else, but from your statements here I think it&#039;s a damn shame you ever carried the EiE tag.&nbsp; Whether you&#039;re just intellectually challenged or the owner of a very weak moral code.</td>
